      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Finishes any clip for a cue as the overnight run does: levelled, trimmed and faded, or looped for music and ambience. Load Audio: the clip (any made in the sound, ambience or music flows). Cue: its name in tools/audio/audio_needs.tsv. Turn install on to add it to the game as the cue's next take (an existing file is never replaced); rebuild the game to hear it."
      ],
